\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30000836 (OWR-1598-003). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Large Scale Stochastic Dynamics (2007), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2007/42, pp. 2443--2530; official report source and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2007/42}.
\item[S3] Official EMS Press PDF of the same Oberwolfach report; PDF pages 14--15, printed pages 2456--2457.
\url{https://ems.press/content/serial-article-files/46130}.
\item[S4] strongly pinned chain; reference in the saved dated catalogue literature review.
\url{https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/0507560}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30000836}

