\subsection{Research attempt}
\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Constructs an exact bath-invisible antisymmetric mode in a connected strongly pinned chain, testing insufficient geometric assumptions.

\paragraph{Sources and literature check.}
The complete supplied definition, including source qualifications and the dated literature assessment, was reviewed. The calculation below is an elementary restricted attempt motivated by [S2]; it does not claim novelty or a fresh literature-status determination.

\paragraph{Context and investigated scope.} The complete supplied definition, including source qualifications and the dated literature assessment, was reviewed. The calculation below is an elementary restricted attempt motivated by [S2]; it does not claim novelty or a fresh literature-status determination.

\paragraph{A connected network with an undamped mode.} Take a three-site chain, pinning $V(q)=\kappa q^2/2$ and interaction $U(q)=cq^2/2$, with $\kappa,c>0$, and attach a Langevin heat bath only to the middle site. Put
\[
 Q=(q_1-q_3)/\sqrt2,\qquad P=(p_1-p_3)/\sqrt2.
\]
Subtracting the two endpoint equations gives $\dot Q=P$ and $\dot P=-(\kappa+c)Q$. The middle displacement cancels, and the bath acts on neither difference. Hence
\[
 E_-=\tfrac12(P^2+(\kappa+c)Q^2)
\]
is exactly conserved, even with the random forcing and friction at site two.

\paragraph{Why stronger pinning does not cure geometry.} The ratio $\kappa/c$ can be arbitrarily large without changing this decoupling. A nonzero edge interaction and graph connectivity therefore do not ensure that every mode exchanges energy with the bath. In the deterministic antisymmetric motion $q_1=-q_3,q_2=0$, the center never moves and no bath dissipation occurs. The example is smooth and confining, and its obstruction is geometric symmetry rather than a subtle large-energy estimate.

\paragraph{Source-scope boundary.} The report already distinguishes geometric obstructions and asks about stronger transmission hypotheses. This example is not claimed to satisfy its asymmetrical-energy-transmitting condition, so it does not refute the qualified source program. It shows why that condition cannot be replaced by connectivity, even in a strongly pinned harmonic case. Proving quantitative transfer for graphs and potentials that exclude all such dark modes, especially nonlinear strongly pinned ones, is the first unresolved step.

\paragraph{Verification and adversarial audit.}
Checked endpoint subtraction, conserved antisymmetric energy, arbitrary pinning/coupling ratio and noncompliance with the source asymmetry hypothesis. Model self-audit only; no independent human proof checking. Prompts A and B were applied to this canonical record and its qualified source scope. Checked endpoint subtraction, conserved antisymmetric energy, arbitrary pinning/coupling ratio and noncompliance with the source asymmetry hypothesis. Retained unresolved status and zero original-target progress; Quantitative transmission under the source condition excluding geometric dark modes is not proved.

Coordinator checked exact cancellation of the middle-site motion from the antisymmetric oscillator and conservation of its energy under the stated bath placement. This additional check was model-assisted, not independent human verification.

\paragraph{Tools, process and contributions.}
Python 3 was used for file preparation and structural checks; no numerical experiment or theorem prover was used. Contribution prompt A was followed by prompt B. GPT-6 Astra with ultra reasoning drafted the research and performed its stated self-audit; any additional coordinator contribution is identified in the verification and audit. A GPT-6-based Codex coordinator assembled the manuscript and checked repository integration; its exact variant and reasoning configuration were not exposed. No human mathematical contribution, independent human proof check or formal proof certification is supplied. Complete derivations and the consulted source references are included here; private reasoning transcripts are not published.

\paragraph{Final status and first remaining gap.}
\textbf{UNRESOLVED}. Quantitative transmission under the source condition excluding geometric dark modes is not proved.

